

translate es strings:

    # game/data/characters/arlena/char.rpy:12
    old "A popular blacksmith's daughter, she studied alongside me when I was younger."
    new "Hija de un herrero popular, estudió a mi lado cuando yo era más joven."

    # game/data/characters/arlena/char.rpy:17
    old "I get the impression she doesn't like me very much..."
    new "Tengo la impresión de que no le caigo muy bien..."

    # game/data/characters/arlena/char.rpy:22
    old "The two of us have become lovers, not that she'd ever admit it without kicking me first!"
    new "¡Los dos nos hemos convertido en amantes, aunque ella nunca lo admitiría sin patearme primero!"

    # game/data/characters/arlena/char.rpy:27
    old "She was killed by the Demorai during the siege. Her memory will live on in my heart."
    new "Fue asesinada por los demorai durante el asedio. Su recuerdo vivirá en mi corazón."
